  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-74",
  "title": "Cablecast Reflect | Pricing",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cablecast Reflect | Pricing"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Based on the current pricing information as of January 28, 2025, the costs for Cablecast REFLECT and REFLECT+ are as follows:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cablecast REFLECT:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "REFLECT VOD Only: $1,300/year"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "REFLECT Live Only: $1,300/year"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-6",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "REFLECT VOD & Live Bundle: $2,400/year[2][8]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Cablecast REFLECT+:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The exact pricing for REFLECT+ is not provided in the search results. However, it is mentioned as an upgrade option from REFLECT[3]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Additional information:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-12",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "REFLECT subscriptions include basic streaming apps for platforms like Apple TV, Roku, Fire TV, and mobile devices[7]."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-13",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Both services offer flexible and scalable subscriptions to meet changing needs[5][7]."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "For REFLECT+, customers need to contact the Cablecast team to discuss storage requirements and pricing[5]."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "It's important to note that pricing may have changed since the information was last updated, so it's advisable to contact Cablecast directly for the most current pricing details, especially for REFLECT+."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Citations:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "[1] [https://www.cablecast.tv/services/add-ons](https://www.cablecast.tv/services/add-ons)"
        }
